This JavaScript ES module is buggy:

```js
export function median(values) {
  const sorted = values.sort();
  return sorted[Math.floor(sorted.length / 2)];
}
```

Fix it so that `median` sorts numerically, averages the two middle values for an even count, does not modify the input array, and throws a RangeError for an empty array.

Reply with a single ```js code block containing the complete ES module and nothing else.

